            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Gà Bà Ba",
            "review_text": "Foina\nLondon21 contributions\n0\nGreat family run Vietnamese restaurant\nMar 2024 • Family\nWe found this gem of a Vietnamese restaurant nestled among many on the street. The service was quick and efficient. Although I opted for a vegetarian dish a most delicious salad which tasted as if the vegetables had only just been picked and a great variety of flavours too. Had my husband felt a bit better we would most definitely had tried one of the dishes served with roasted chicken as they looked so delicious.\nThe staff were very happy and helpful\nRead more\nWritten March 30, 2024",
